␀␀, older lines rotated out␀␀␀PROBLEMS␀␀␀␀Commands:
  status            firmware, sensors, presence, Wi-Fi, display, log
  sensors [s]       live sensor readings for s seconds (default 10)
  rules             the rules (set them on the web page) and how often they fired
  config            show the hardware config (JSON) and its pins
  config set {...}  replace the hardware config (the web flasher does this), then restart
  config reset      back to the setup this firmware was made with (or the chip default), then restart
  log [n]           last n log lines (default 10)
  verify            check the log chain
  health            what is wrong right now and how to fix it
  debug on|off|show|clear   debug mode: the console, plus status every 30 s, saved to storage
  join SSID PASS    join a network (use the web flasher or web page if the name has spaces)
  forget            forget the saved Wi-Fi network
  setup             open the setup network for 10 minutes
  name NAME         rename the device
  hold S            seconds to stay present after the last detection
  maxcm CM          ignore LD2410 targets further away than this
  flip              turn the screen upside down
  txpower auto|19.5|15|11|8.5   Wi-Fi transmit power in dBm (auto lowers itself after a brownout)
  reboot
  factory YES       erase settings, Wi-Fi, hardware config and the log (new signing key)
